  "citation": "Fung I (1993): Goddard Institute for Space Studies (GISS) 3-Dimensional (3-D) Global Tracer Transport Model (DB1006). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA) Goddard Institute for Space Studies (GISS), NASA. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CYC.DB1006",
  "dataset": {
